  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting Productivity Through Human Capital Development Program (Subprogram 1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Boosting Productivity through Human Capital Development Program focuses on economic growth through labor productivity. The program covers various aspects of human capital development, including education, skills development, health, and social assistance all wrapped within the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) framework. The program is consistent with (i) the government&amp;apos;s National Medium-Term Development Plan (RPJMN), 2020-2024 directives on human resources development and (ii) the first strategic pathway of ADB&amp;apos;s country partnership strategy for Indonesia, 2020-2024.</narrative>
  </description>
